
"smart_sources:HTML-CSS-JavaScript_Workspace/Jonas JavaScript/Section 3 - JavaScript Fundamental Part 2/45.1. FAQ.md": {"path":"HTML-CSS-JavaScript_Workspace/Jonas JavaScript/Section 3 - JavaScript Fundamental Part 2/45.1. FAQ.md","last_embed":{"hash":null},"embeddings":{},"last_read":{"hash":"hr70we","at":1766336624104},"class_name":"SmartSource","last_import":{"mtime":1753171242167,"size":14032,"at":1766336624106,"hash":"hr70we"},"blocks":{"#":[1,10],"#---frontmatter---":[3,9],"###Q1: What exactly is an \"object method\" in JavaScript?":[11,20],"###Q1: What exactly is an \"object method\" in JavaScript?#{1}":[13,20],"###Q2: How do I define or add a method to an object?":[21,50],"###Q2: How do I define or add a method to an object?#{1}":[23,50],"###Q3: Can I use a function declaration (e.g., `function calcAge() {...}`) directly to define an object method?":[51,75],"###Q3: Can I use a function declaration (e.g., `function calcAge() {...}`) directly to define an object method?#{1}":[53,75],"###Q4: How do I call an object method once it's defined?":[76,109],"###Q4: How do I call an object method once it's defined?#{1}":[78,109],"###Q5: What is the `this` keyword, and how does it work inside an object method?":[110,143],"###Q5: What is the `this` keyword, and how does it work inside an object method?#{1}":[112,143],"###Q6: Why should I use `this.propertyName` inside a method instead of `objectName.propertyName` (e.g., `this.birthYear` vs. `jonas.birthYear`)?":[144,177],"###Q6: Why should I use `this.propertyName` inside a method instead of `objectName.propertyName` (e.g., `this.birthYear` vs. `jonas.birthYear`)?#{1}":[146,177],"###Q7: Can a method create and store new properties on the object it belongs to? Why would I do that?":[178,218],"###Q7: Can a method create and store new properties on the object it belongs to? Why would I do that?#{1}":[180,218],"###Q8: Can an object method call another method of the _same_ object?":[219,257],"###Q8: Can an object method call another method of the _same_ object?#{1}":[221,257],"###Q9: How are object methods (that I define) different from standalone functions I've written before?":[258,270],"###Q9: How are object methods (that I define) different from standalone functions I've written before?#{1}":[260,270],"###Q10: The transcript mentions that arrays are also objects and have methods like `push()`. How does that relate to what I just learned about object methods?":[271,280],"###Q10: The transcript mentions that arrays are also objects and have methods like `push()`. How does that relate to what I just learned about object methods?#{1}":[273,280],"###Q11: In \"Coding Challenge #3\" (Mark and John BMI), how was the `this` keyword used within the objects to calculate BMI?":[281,330],"###Q11: In \"Coding Challenge #3\" (Mark and John BMI), how was the `this` keyword used within the objects to calculate BMI?#{1}":[283,330]},"outlinks":[],"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[[31,45],[61,72],[84,104],[122,138],[156,174],[190,213],[229,252],[291,328]]},